# The build context is the repository root (docker-compose.test.yml sets
# `context: .`), but this image contains no repository sources at all — only
# the three scripts under testing/docker. Everything else is noise that would
# invalidate the image cache on every unrelated edit.
*
!testing/docker/entrypoint.sh
!testing/docker/build_ws.sh
!testing/docker/start_sim.sh
